H8106B.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:12; 
son of: Elpaal (H0508); 
brother of: Eber (H5677I), Misham (H4936), Beriah (H1283I), Shema (H8087I), Zebadiah (H2069H), Meshullam (H4918J), Hizki (H2395), Heber (H2268J), Ishmerai (H3461), Izliah (H3152) and Jobab (H3103K)
§ Shemed or Shamed = "destroyed"
a Benjamite, son of Elpaal and builder of the towns of Ono and Lod

H8106G.def:
A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 6:46; 
son of: Mahli (H4249H); 
father of: Bani (H1137H)
§ Shemed or Shamed = "destroyed"
a Benjamite, son of Elpaal and builder of the towns of Ono and Lod

H8106H.def:
A man of the tribe of Asher living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:32; 
son of: Heber (H2268); 
brother of: Japhlet (H3310), Hotham (H2369) and Shua (H7774); 
father of: Ahi (H0277H), Rohgah (H7303), Jehubbah (H3160) and Aram (H0758J); also called Shemer (KJV: Shamer) at 1 Chroniques 7:34; 
Another name of sho.mer (שֹׁמֵר "Shomer" H7763H)
§ Shemed or Shamed = "destroyed"
a Benjamite, son of Elpaal and builder of the towns of Ono and Lod

H8110B.def:
A man of the tribe of Issachar living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:13; 
son of: Issachar (H3485); 
brother of: Tola (H8439), Puah (H6312) and Jashub (H3437H)
Also named: shim.ro.ni (שִׁמְרֹנִי "Shimronite" H8117)
§ Shimron = "watch-height"
4th son of Issachar and the progenitor of the family of Shimronites

H8114H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 2 Chroniques 11:19; 
son of: Rehoboam (H7346) and Mahalath (H4258H); 
brother of: Jeush (H3266K) and Zaham (H2093); 
half-brother of: Abijah (H0029I), Attai (H6262I), Ziza (H2124H) and Shelomith (H8019G)
§ Shemariah = "kept by Jehovah"
1) a Benjamite, one of David's mighty warriors who joined him at Ziklag
2) a son of king Rehoboam of Judah
3) an Israelite of the sons of Harim who had a foreign wife in the time of Ezra
4) an Israelite of the sons of Bani who had a foreign wife in the time of Ezra

H8116.def:
A man of the Moabites living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Rois 12:21; 
father of: Jehozabad (H3075); also called Shimrith at 2 Chroniques 24:26; 
Another name of sho.mer (שֹׁמֵר "Shomer" H7763G) 
§ Shimrith = "vigilant"
a Moabitess, mother of Jehozabad, one of the assassins of king Joash of Judah

H8117.def:
Someone descended from Shimron who was a man of the tribe of Issachar living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:13; 
son of: Issachar (H3485); 
brother of: Tola (H8439), Puah (H6312) and Jashub (H3437H)
Group of shim.ron (שִׁמְרוֹן "Shimron" H8110B) 
§ Shimronites, of Shimron "guardian"
descendants of Shimron

H8119.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:21; 
son of: Shimei (H8096N); 
brother of: Jakim (H3356), Zichri (H2147H), Zabdi (H2067H), Elienai (H0462), Zillethai (H6769), Eliel (H0447H), Adaiah (H5718H) and Beraiah (H1256) 
§ Shimrath = "guard"
a Benjamite, son of Shimei

H8125.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:26; 
son of: Jeroham (H3395H); 
brother of: Shehariah (H7841), Athaliah (H6271H), Jaareshiah (H3298), Elijah (H0452H) and Zichri (H2147J) 
§ Shamsherai = "sunlike"
a Benjamite, son of Jeroham

H8137.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 3:18; 
son of: Shealtiel (H7597A)(?); 
brother of: Malchiram (H4443), Pedaiah (H6305H), Jekamiah (H3359H), Hoshama (H1953) and Nedabiah (H5072) 
§ Shenazar = "splendid leader"
a Judaite of the royal line, son or grandson of king Jehoiachin of Judah and uncle of Zerubbabel

H8174G.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:47; 
son of Caleb (H3612H) and Jahdai (H3056); 
brother of: Regem (H7276), Jotham (H3147I), Geshan (H1529), Pelet (H6404) and Ephah (H5891I)
§ Shaaph = "division"
1) son of Jahdai of the family of Caleb, the brother of Jerahmeel
2) son of Caleb, the brother of Jerahmeel, by his concubine Maachah and father of Madmannah

H8174H.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:49; 
son of: Caleb (H3612H) and Maacah (H4601L); 
brother of: Sheber (H7669), Tirhanah (H8647) and Sheva (H7724); 
half-brother of: Hur (H2354), Jesher (H3475), Shobab (H7727H), Ardon (H0715), Mareshah@1 Chroniques 2:42 (H4337), Haran (H2771B), Moza (H4162), Gazez (H1495), Jahdai (H3056) and Achsah (H5915H)
§ Shaaph = "division"
1) son of Jahdai of the family of Caleb, the brother of Jerahmeel
2) son of Caleb, the brother of Jerahmeel, by his concubine Maachah and father of Madmannah

H8187.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Divided Monarchy, first mentioned at 1 Chroniques 8:38; 
son of: Azel (H0682A); 
brother of: Azrikam (H5840H), Bocheru (H1074), Ishmael (H3458I), Obadiah (H5662J) and Hanan (H2605H) 
§ Sheariah = "valued by Jehovah"
a Benjamite of the family of Saul, one of the 6 sons of Azel

H8195.def:
A man living at the time of the Patriarchs, first mentioned at Genèse 36:23; 
son of: Shobal (H7732); 
brother of: Alvan (H5935), Manahath (H4506B), Ebal (H5858B) and Onam (H0208) 
§ Shepho or Shephi = "bold"
an Edomite, son of Shobal of the sons of Seir

H8197A.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:21; 
son of: Benjamin (H1144); 
brother of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); also called Shephupham (KJV, NIV: Shupham) at Nombres 26:39; Shephuphan at 1 Chroniques 8:5; 
Another name of mup.pim (מֻפִּים "Muppim" H4649)
§ Shephuphan or Shupham = "serpent"
son of Bela and grandson of Benjamin

H8197B.def:
A man of the tribe of Benjamin living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Genèse 46:21; 
son of: Benjamin (H1144); 
brother of: Bela (H1106A), Becher (H1071), Ashbel (H0788), Gera (H1617), Naaman (H5283), Ehi (H0278), Rosh (H7220), Huppim (H2650H), Ard (H0714), Ahiram (H0297) and Jediael (H3043); also called Shephupham (KJV, NIV: Shupham) at Nombres 26:39; Shephuphan at 1 Chroniques 8:5; 
Another name of mup.pim (מֻפִּים "Muppim" H4649)
§ Shephuphan or Shupham = "serpent"
son of Bela and grandson of Benjamin
